91a2b9ea87c6565956af9324169564ecc2f8182a33776ef04776fe9d06a8ee31fab4060ea4eea555490db83b9dbb26d873000f16c78eb1b9381532166a5558d5  i3status-rs-0.40.1.1
814419845a7b0b07fb686458f3a6263b79f6fb544e1e9418b0be981296b70ccb297b5ada256605dd85604ccc50922390acfbb81c426131d53762c0662ab62f7e  cargo-update.patch
"
